---
// The definitions of the nineteen prints, the two gradients and the one filter that gives every print the look
// of the logo. Rendered once per page, hidden; Print.astro places a print with <use>.
// p1 to p9: the nine parts. c1 to c5: the chain of verification. q, k, e, t: page headers. r: an open ring.
